{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>警方表示，荃灣警區特別職務隊人員聯同入境處，根據線報及經深入調查後，昨日（21日）展開代號「嶺馬」的掃黃行動。執法人員在川龍街、眾安街、海壩街及二陂坊一帶，共拘捕7名內地女子，年齡介乎31歲至47歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕人正被扣留調查，稍後將交入境處跟進。</p><p>據了解，所有被捕內地女子持雙程證到港。</p><figure><img alt=\"執法人員拘捕多名女子。（警方提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189733151459512320734561.jpeg/6HtktRpjC1_y29rWQQgtmAQakhQSm4Ip0vR8YNL0fGA\"/><figcaption>執法人員拘捕多名女子。（警方提供）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T16:40:40.409724+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:28:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T16:37:41.785269+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T16:37:41.785269+00:00","content_hash":"161940aa421046e4fa7d2bf25d92a419678d64843bfedf6b5ad4b1aaf0e43467","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}